    "title": "Persistence",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "t": "p",
        "text": "Everything persists. Nothing is regenerated on reload."
      },
      {
        "t": "p",
        "text": "**Tracked and permanent:** every item and its condition; every coin, debt, and price paid; Depth and Standing; every ability learned and every working inscribed; every event that happened, with timestamp and cause; every NPC's facts, beliefs, relationships, goals, and secrets; every arc's state and every clock's position; the price history of the economy; every rumour in flight and who believes it; every unfired gun in the director's ledger; the player's Debt and Stain; the full transcript of the story so far."
      },
      {
        "t": "p",
        "text": "**Save model:** one world, many timelines. The player can fork a save before a fatal choice and live both — and the engine keeps a **Timeline** view, because a world about revision should let you see your own drafts."
      }
    ]
